 "remarks": "Storybook charm and modern updates come together in this picture-perfect 4-bedroom Cape, ideally situated on a quiet cul-de-sac. Featuring 2 full and 1 half baths, a beautifully renovated kitchen, and updated bathrooms, this sun-filled home offers warmth, character, and effortless everyday living. Step outside to a picturesque, fully fenced backyard, perfect for entertaining, relaxing, and outdoor play. Enjoy the convenience of strolling to downtown Darien, trains, and schools, all while tucked away in a peaceful neighborhood setting.A rare opportunity to enjoy the best of Darien living in an unbeatable location.",
